126	    /**
127	     * Handles {@link InvalidOwnerFieldsException} thrown when an owner is created or updated with
128	     * required fields that are missing or blank (for example, whitespace-only values that Bean
129	     * Validation does not reject). Returns a 400 Bad Request whose {@code errors} array lists the
130	     * name of each offending field.
